        {
          "id": "txt_summary",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "**Summary**\nThe 2022 MacBook Air (M2) introduced a redesigned chassis, a slightly larger and brighter Liquid Retina display, and the upgraded M2 silicon, while the 2020 model (M1) remains a benchmark for value and efficiency in the classic wedge-shaped design."
